				"description": "The usage summary read from the selected provider event, where each number is a finite non-negative value or null when the source value is missing, non-numeric, negative or non-finite. For claude, inputTokens is input plus cache-read plus cache-write tokens and is null if any part is null; for codex, inputTokens is the raw input_tokens count, which already includes cached tokens.",
